{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Family Reunion</i> blends the awkwardness of family dinners with the structure of incremental and narrative games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family Reunion takes inspiration from the mechanics of a family dinner when you are a child and all you want to do is everything BUT being there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to make the time reach to zero as fast as you can, but it starts being suuper slow! You have to use the resources of your imagination, conversation and exploration skills to make the pass by faster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/7e5e98b80950c34cf7e8d127bc0f9149.poster.avif?t=1767064127\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/7e5e98b80950c34cf7e8d127bc0f9149.webm?t=1767064127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/7e5e98b80950c34cf7e8d127bc0f9149.mp4?t=1767064127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between three archetypes \u2014 <strong>Introvert</strong>, <strong>Chatty</strong>, or <strong>Adventurer</strong> \u2014 each offering a different way to survive the dinner: through imagination, conversation, or exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1f86714832a80a0d9a1291b8750e7f2b.apng?t=1767064127\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1f86714832a80a0d9a1291b8750e7f2b.poster.avif?t=1767064127\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/4d5a575a0464790a58623a55de729ed9.gif?t=1767064127\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/4d5a575a0464790a58623a55de729ed9.poster.avif?t=1767064127\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1d1ec2651900f0c596300a96bf166945.gif?t=1767064127\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/1d1ec2651900f0c596300a96bf166945.poster.avif?t=1767064127\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you interact with the people and objects around you, new abilities and events unfold:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore deep into the house for looting items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ideas from your actions to broaden your mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid your family interventions or make them your allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get some food for boosting your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/f5719485b599e95c311d75d12de62ae2.poster.avif?t=1767064127\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/f5719485b599e95c311d75d12de62ae2.webm?t=1767064127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/f5719485b599e95c311d75d12de62ae2.mp4?t=1767064127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your make time faster and speed run the F A MI LY REUNION?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100460?t=1767064127","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100460?t=1767064127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/78ca534618a5254615498c1512d8478d79a09951/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767064127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/78ca534618a5254615498c1512d8478d79a09951/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767064127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Family Reunion</i> blends the awkwardness of family dinners with the structure of incremental and narrative games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family Reunion takes inspiration from the mechanics of a family dinner when you are a child and all you want to do is everything BUT being there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to make the time reach to zero as fast as you can, but it starts being suuper slow! You have to use the resources of your imagination, conversation and exploration skills to make the pass by faster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/7e5e98b80950c34cf7e8d127bc0f9149.poster.avif?t=1767064127\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100460/extras/7e5e98b80950c34cf7e8d127bc0f9149.webm?t=1767064127\" type=